<title>ALGERIA: Port conditions update - Algeria - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Algeria - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Algiers, March 30 - During the last two weeks 10 to 12 vessels reported at anchorage awaiting berths, average time on roads about two or three days.</p>
</text>
